    "body": "The above paragraphs already talk about secure connections implicitly, so maybe some of this should be moved up?\r\n\r\nFor HTTP/3, I'm not sure you need to add anything, though if you wanted to say \"If a secure transport is used, such as TLS over TCP or QUIC, ...\" that could clarify that you're including both.",
